<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Admin dashboard</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Admin Dashboard</h1>

<p>Welcome back, Admin!</p>

<p>
    Manage your portfolio, update your projects, maintain your skills,
    and keep track of messages from visitors — all from one place.
</p>

<h2>Manage Your Portfolio</h2>

<p>
    Choose an option below to manage the content displayed on your
    personal portfolio website.
</p>

<div class="admin-cards">

    <div class="card">
        <h3>➕ Add Project</h3>
        <p>
            Showcase your latest work by adding a new project
            to your portfolio.
        </p>
        <a href="/admin/projects/add">Add Project →</a>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h3>✏️ Edit Project</h3>
        <p>
            Update project details or remove projects that
            you no longer want to display.
        </p>
        <a href="/admin/projects/edit">Manage Projects →</a>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h3>🛠️ Manage Skills</h3>
        <p>
            Add new technical skills and update the skills
            displayed on your portfolio.
        </p>
        <a href="/admin/skills">Manage Skills →</a>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h3>💬 View Messages</h3>
        <p>
            Check messages and inquiries sent by visitors
            through your portfolio contact form.
        </p>
        <a href="/admin/message">View Messages →</a>
    </div>

</div>

<h2>Quick Overview</h2>

<p>
    Keep your portfolio up to date by regularly adding new
    projects and maintaining your skills.
</p>
<br><br>

<a href="/">Back to Portfolio</a>
</body>
</html>